{
  "_meta": {
    "chapter": 22,
    "scope": "Alcoholic beverages, MFN rates. FTA schedules (ATIGA, MAFTA, MNZFTA) to be added in Sprint 2.",
    "notes": [
      "Import duty from Customs Duties Order 2022 P.U.(A) 114/2022 (MFN column). Per-litre rates are per litre of beverage.",
      "Excise v1 from Excise Duties Order 2022 P.U.(A) 163/2022, in force 1 June 2022 to 31 Oct 2025.",
      "Excise v2 = v1 + 10% from 1 Nov 2025 per Budget 2026 (tabled 10 Oct 2025). Beer RM192.50 confirmed by Confederation of Malaysian Brewers. REPLACE with gazetted Excise Duties (Amendment) Order figures before launch.",
      "SST 10% on (CIF + duty + excise) for all chapter 22 alcohol lines.",
      "Excise Duties Order 2025, P.U.(A) 389/2025, gazetted 31 Oct 2025, in force 1 Nov 2025, revokes P.U.(A) 163/2022. Every chapter-22 line checked against the gazette on 3 Nov 2026: all 28 equal the 2022 rate × 1.10."
    ],
    "sources": {
